      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@value": "The kind (safety vs efficacy) is cr:summaryKind, a value \u2014 not two classes (ADR-0024). Multi-study by construction: >=1 cr:integratesStudy, each referenced by IRI. Derives from the per-study ADaM datasets via prov:wasDerivedFrom, so the integrated number is reproducible to each study's source."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
