        "@value": "trial registration"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@value": "The public trial-registry record for a study (ClinicalTrials.gov, EUCTR, ISRCTN): its registration, and later its posted results \u2014 the FDAAA 801 / EU CTR transparency obligation."
      }
