        "@value": "Links the Constraint to the Agent responsible for oversight. The IRB enforces the inclusion criterion; the QA Lead enforces the calibration window; the Pharmacist enforces the dose limit."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
