        "@value": "When the system recorded this entity-version \u2014 the transaction-time anchor (per ADR-0021), NGSI-LD-style. Distinct from valid time (top:validFrom / top:validUntil, the second clock, opt-in) and from intrinsic activity times (Temporal.startTime / endTime, domain-level)."
